WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.867 --> 00:00:10.243
It was the first night of Hanukkah.

2
00:00:10.244 --> 00:00:15.677
We lit the menorah!

3
00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:19.083
It was the second night of Hanukkah.

4
00:00:19.084 --> 00:00:22.986
We played spin the dreidel!

5
00:00:22.987 --> 00:00:27.029
It was the third night of Hanukkah.

6
00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:32.181
We made potato pancakes!

7
00:00:32.182 --> 00:00:35.459
It was the fourth night of Hanukkah.

8
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:40.530
We sang songs!

9
00:00:40.531 --> 00:00:44.127
It was the fifth night of Hanukkah.

10
00:00:44.128 --> 00:00:47.811
We ate doughnuts!

11
00:00:47.812 --> 00:00:51.122
It was the sixth night of Hanukkah.

12
00:00:51.123 --> 00:00:56.086
We opened presents!

13
00:00:56.087 --> 00:00:59.680
It was the seventh night of Hanukkah.

14
00:00:59.681 --> 00:01:02.721
Grandma and Grandpa came over!

15
00:01:02.722 --> 00:01:06.459
It was the eighth night of Hanukkah.

16
00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:11.589
We ate chocolate!
